    "summary": "<em>Nkisi</em> is an object that is believed to host an ancestral spirit. Unusual among these figures, this nkisi figure is missing its <em>nduda,</em> “night guns.” These guns would be filled with gunpowder functioning as defense against witches or misfortune. Unless its guns were lost during the course of its life history, this nkisi may instead be an example of a more general type called <em>mpanzu,</em> whose functions included protection.",
